# Cursor Rules for Autopik (tidjan-autopik)

When designing or integrating UI components needing illustrations:
1. Use `npx tidjan-autopik smart "<concept>"` to automatically select, colorize, and integrate illustrations.
2. Supports multi-providers: `undraw`, `openpeeps`, and `iradesign`.
3. Auto-detects Tailwind & CSS `--primary` color variables and dark mode.
4. Generates typed components for React, Next.js, Vue 3, Svelte, and Flutter.
